    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292">

                <pb facs="0352" n="1186" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1186"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 657.119/476</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The French Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Jusserand</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1918</hi>.</date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 18.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to
                    acknowledge the receipt of your letter of the 3d instant transmitting a copy of
                    the rationing agreement negotiated between the War Trade Board and the special
                    Norwegian representative, and dated April 30, 1918.</p>
                <p>As mentioned by you, these negotiations have been followed by an authorized
                    representative of the French High Commissioner working in conjunction with the
                    War Trade Board. In answer to your question, I take pleasure in informing you
                    that my Government fully approves the articles of this agreement.</p>
                <p>Believe me [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jusserand</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
